    <briefdescription>
<para>Log management. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides logging capabilities with configurable channels, severity levels, and sinks.</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">Logger<sp/>logger<sp/>=<sp/>Logger::Console(Severity::Debug)<sp/>;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">LOG_DEBUG(logger)<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>&quot;Debug<sp/>message&quot;<sp/>;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
